<title>INDIA: India raises groundnut support price.</title>
<headline>India raises groundnut support price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian government on Monday raised the minimum support price for groundnut to 980 rupees per quintal from 920, a government spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
